{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49716","headline":"河传 四 · 孙光宪","name":"河传 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风颭，波敛，团荷闪闪，珠倾露点。\n木兰舟上，何处吴娃越艳，藕花红照脸。\n大堤狂杀襄阳客，烟波隔，渺渺湖光白。\n身已归，心不归，斜晖，远汀鸂鶒飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙光宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}